    <node id="&quot;TURKEY SHOOT (2014 FILM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MOVIE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Turkey Shoot (2014 film) is a 2014 Australian dystopian futurist exploitation film directed by Jon Hewitt, inspired by the 1982 film."</data>
